<section class="ph"><div class="ph-media"><img class="ph-img" src="/assets/img/photos/lightning.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/lightning-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/lightning.webp 1200w" sizes="100vw" width="1200" height="626" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></div><div class="wrap ph-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><i aria-hidden="true">/</i><a href="/mi-claim-calculators/">Calculators</a><i aria-hidden="true">/</i><span aria-current="page">Percentage Deductible Calculator</span></nav><p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Free calculator</p><h1>Percentage Deductible Calculator for Michigan Policies</h1><p class="ph-lede">More Michigan policies now carry percentage deductibles, often for wind and hail. A 2% deductible on a $340,000 dwelling is $6,800, not $2. See what yours means.</p></div></section>
